    "timing_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "pan-timing",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-pepper {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 300px);\n    gap: 34px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__rows {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 15px 17px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n    gap: 10px 16px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__name {\n    grid-column: 1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__tag {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: var(--gold);\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__meter {\n    grid-column: 2;\n    grid-row: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 4px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip {\n    width: 9px;\n    height: 9px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d8cfc0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip.is-on {\n    background: #b8462f;\n    border-color: #b8462f;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__note {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__legend {\n    margin: 16px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__cap {\n    margin: 10px 0 0;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 989px) {\n    .sea-pepper {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__figure {\n      order: -1;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"sea-pepper\">\n  <div class=\"sea-pepper__grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"sea-pepper__body\">\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__eyebrow\">One pan, three different clocks</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sea-pepper__heading\">Nothing goes in at the same time, and that is the entire recipe.</h2>\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__lede\">\n        A whole trout, halved baby potatoes and grapes want very different amounts of oven, and\n        the only difficulty in this dish is getting all three to finish together. Stagger them and\n        it is genuinely easy. Put them all in at once and you get one of three failures, every\n        time.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__rows\">\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Baby potatoes &mdash; in first</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">0 min</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Oven time: 5 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">About 38 minutes of oven in total. They get a 15-minute head start alone, and halved they need every bit of it &mdash; potatoes are the only thing here that is forgiving at the top end.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row sea-pepper__row--pick\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>The trout &mdash; joins at 15 min</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Start the clock</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Oven time: 3 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">About 23 minutes. A stuffed 12 oz whole fish at 425&deg;F needs it. Twelve minutes, which is the number people reach for, leaves it raw along the spine.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>The grapes &mdash; join at 27 min</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Last</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Oven time: 2 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Ten to twelve minutes, no more. Put them in with the potatoes and they spend nearly half an hour in the oven and collapse into jam. You want them holding their shape and just splitting.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>The broiler &mdash; final 1&ndash;2 min</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">Watch it</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Oven time: 1 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Long enough to blister and caramelise the grape skins, short enough not to scorch the fish. Broilers vary more than ovens do, so stand there and watch rather than trusting a timer.</p>\n      </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__legend\">\n        Ratings are how much oven each component wants, not how much attention. The trout is the one\n        to measure: 135&deg;F at the thickest part behind the head, and the flesh should flake when\n        you look into one of the slashes.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"sea-pepper__figure\">\n      <img\n        src=\"{{ '20260825-Stetten-Wilson-212.jpg' | file_url }}&amp;width=700\"\n        alt=\"A sheet pan of whole roasted trout with potatoes and grapes being lifted from the oven\"\n        width=\"1200\"\n        height=\"1600\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\">\n      <figcaption class=\"sea-pepper__cap\">\n        Everything lands at once because nothing went in together &mdash; potatoes at zero, fish at\n        fifteen, grapes at twenty-seven.\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 16,
