    "rich_text_standard": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "f_sub": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "The fish under the spice",
            "subheading_size": "subtitle-md",
            "secondary_color": true
          }
        },
        "f_head": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why cook it whole",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "f_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The bones and skin do the work a fillet needs you to do for it. Cooked on the frame, the flesh keeps its moisture and picks up everything in the cavity &mdash; lemon, rosemary, garlic &mdash; from the inside out. It is also the cheaper way to buy fish per edible ounce, and it is the format that makes a sheet pan look like an occasion.</p><p>This one is sashimi-grade, blast-frozen to &minus;10&deg;F at harvest and vacuum sealed. Every supplier is tested before we approve them, then randomly audited to ensure consistent compliance with the Seatopia Standard &mdash; third-party lab tested for nutrition, mercury and microplastics, and sourced from best-in-class aquaculture. The Urfa pepper in the almond butter also turns up in our <a href=\"/blogs/seafood-recipes/urfa-pepper-ora-king-salmon-warm-apple-farro-salad\">Urfa pepper king salmon</a>, if you want another use for the jar.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "f_btn": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "How we source it",
            "button_link": "/pages/why-clean-seafood-matters",
            "button_style": "secondary",
            "button_size": "md",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "f_sub",
        "f_head",
        "f_text",
        "f_btn"
      ],
